sociation from causal effects. Develop and validate measures of social outcomes, including human and LLM-assisted annotations; assess measurement error, subgroup performanc\u2026", "salary_min": null, "salary_max": null, "salary_currency": null, "apply_url": "https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/openai/73875295-889e-4373-b20f-654e85c66ba4", "original_url": "https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/openai/73875295-889e-4373-b20f-654e85c66ba4", "is_active": true, "department": "Product Policy", "score": 11.3, "score_reasons": ["title:applied scientist", "skills:data,engineering,python,skills"]}, {"job_id": "greenhouse:8187582003", "title": "Sr. Software Engineer, Machine Learning & Data Infrastructure", "company": "OKX", "location": "San Jose, California, United States", "country": "US", "remote": false, "ats": "greenhouse", "source": "company-career-page", "posted_at": "2026-11-14T05:47:31+00:00", "discovered_at": "2026-11-15T05:29:51.404281+00:00", "description": "", "salary_min": null, "salary_max": null, "salary_currency": null, "apply_url": "https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/okx/jobs/8187582003", "original_url": "https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/okx/jobs/8187582003", "is_active": true, "department": null, "score": 14.6, "score_reasons": ["title:machine learning", "title:software engineer", "skills:data,engineer,software"]}]